    "description": "Artist Unknown\nNatural Agate Geode Bookends\nPolished Stone and Raw Matrix\n6\" x 4\" x 7\"\nUnsigned\nThis striking pair of natural agate bookends showcases a brilliant crystalline interior with unique teal and moss green banding. Each piece is masterfully cut and polished on the interior faces to reveal a dense field of translucent quartz crystals and intricate chalcedony layers. The exterior retains its original, rugged earthy matrix, providing a dramatic contrast between the raw geological formation and the luminous, refined center.\nFeatures vibrant teal and green mineral inclusions within a clear to white crystalline structure\nHeavily weighted at 5 lbs to provide functional support for significant volumes\nPolished flat bases and interior sides for stable display on shelving or desks\nCondition:\nVery good vintage condition. The polished faces are smooth with high luster and no significant scratching or chips to the crystalline areas. The natural stone matrix shows characteristic rugged texture and minor age-appropriate surface wear. Each piece remains structurally sound and heavy.\nPlease Note:\nThis is a pre-owned item being sold\nas-is\n. We do our best to describe items accurately and include research where possible, but we are not experts in every category. Please note that if the title or description states \"Tested\" that we only test to make sure the unit \"\nPOWERS ON\"\n.\nNo further testing takes place unless stated otherwise and items are considered untested.\nPlease remember all items are used and are sold as is, no refunds.If you have questions, please contact us before bidding.\nFor all vintage clothing, please research sizing before placing a bid.\nItems from different time periods may have measurements that differ from today’s standard sizing.\nCustomer Service:\nReach us via the “Contact Us” link above or by calling\n(540) 361-6550\n. Messages are handled Monday–Friday, 8:00 AM–4:00 PM ET, and we strive to respond within 48 hours.",
